#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/upcloud/upcloud.rst:7
msgid ""
"UpCloud is a cloud hosting provider that offers both Linux and Windows "
"virtual machines on their MAXIOPS infrastructure which is billed as I.A.A.S "
"( infrastructure-as-a-service ). They have datacenters based in the UK, USA,"
" Germany, Netherlands, Singapore and Finland. Servers can be created a "
"lightning fast 45 seconds with their faster than SSD technology."
msgstr ""
"UpCloud es una nube hosting proveedor que offers both Linux y Windows "
"virtual machines on their MAXIOPS infrastructure cual es billed as I.A.A.S ("
" infrastructure-as-un-servicio ). They tienen datacenters based in el UK, "
"USA, Germany, Netherlands, Singapore y Finland. Servers se puede crear un "
"lightning fast 45 seconds con their faster than SSD technology."

