#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:1
msgid "**Advanced Options**"
msgstr "**Advanced Options**"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:3
msgid "DOMAIN"
msgstr "DOMAIN"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:4
msgid "Specify a default domain for instances provisioned to this Cloud."
msgstr ""
"Specify un predeterminado domain para instances provisioned to este Cloud."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:5
msgid "SCALE PRIORITY"
msgstr "SCALE PRIORITY"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:6
msgid ""
"Only affects Docker Provisioning. Specifies the priority with which an "
"instance will scale into the cloud. A lower priority number means this cloud"
" integration will take scale precedence over other cloud integrations in the"
" group."
msgstr ""
"Only affects Docker Provisioning. Specifies el priority con cual una "
"instancia será scale en la nube. A lower priority número means esta nube "
"integration será take scale precedence over otro cloud integrations in el "
"grupo."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:7
msgid "APPLIANCE URL"
msgstr "APPLIANCE URL"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:8
msgid ""
"Alternate Appliance url for scenarios when the default Appliance URL "
"(configured in `admin > settings`) is not reachable or resolvable for "
"Instances provisioned in this cloud. The Appliance URL is used for Agent "
"install and reporting."
msgstr ""
"Alternate Appliance url para scenarios cuando el predeterminado Appliance "
"URL (configurado in `admin > configuración`) no es reachable o resolvable "
"para Instances provisioned in esta nube. The Appliance URL se utiliza para "
"Agent install y reporting."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:9
msgid "TIME ZONE"
msgstr "TIME ZONE"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:10
msgid "Configures the time zone on provisioned VM's if necessary."
msgstr "Configures el time zone on provisioned VM's si es necesario."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:11
msgid "DATACENTER ID"
msgstr "DATACENTER ID"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:12
msgid ""
"Used for differentiating pricing among multiple datacenters. Leave blank "
"unless prices are properly configured."
msgstr ""
"Used para differentiating pricing among múltiples datacenters. Leave blank "
"unless prices son properly configurado."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:13
msgid "NETWORK MODE"
msgstr "NETWORK MODE"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:14
msgid "Unmanaged or select a Network Integration (NSX, ACI etc)"
msgstr "Unmanaged o select un Network Integration (NSX, ACI etc)"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:15
msgid "LOCAL FIREWALL"
msgstr "LOCAL FIREWALL"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:16
msgid ""
"On or Off. Enable to managed Host and VM firewall/IP Table rules (linux "
"only)"
msgstr ""
"On o Off. Enable to managed Host y VM firewall/IP Table rules (linux solo)"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:17
msgid "SECURITY SERVER"
msgstr "SECURITY SERVER"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:18
msgid ""
"Security Server setting is for Security Service Integrations such as ACI"
msgstr ""
"Security Server setting es para Security Service Integrations como ACI"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:19
msgid "TRUST PROVIDER"
msgstr "TRUST PROVIDER"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:20
msgid "Select Internal (Morpheus) or an existing Trust Provider Integration"
msgstr "Select Internal (Morpheus) o un existente Trust Provider Integration"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:21
msgid "STORAGE MODE"
msgstr "STORAGE MODE"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:22
msgid "Single Disk, LVM or Clustered"
msgstr "Single Disk, LVM o Clustered"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:23
msgid "BACKUP PROVIDER"
msgstr "BACKUP PROVIDER"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:24
msgid ""
"Select a backup provider. Depending on the Cloud type and any currently-"
"configured backup plugins you may select Internal Backups (Morpheus) or "
"another configured backup solution"
msgstr ""
"Select un backup proveedor. Dependiendo de el Cloud tipo y cualquier "
"actualmente-configurado backup plugins you puede select Internal Backups "
"(Morpheus) o another configurado backup solution"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:25
msgid "REPLICATION PROVIDER"
msgstr "REPLICATION PROVIDER"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:26
msgid ""
"Sets the default Replication Provider for the Cloud. Select an existing "
"Replication Provider Integration"
msgstr ""
"Sets el predeterminado Replication Provider para el Cloud. Select un "
"existente Replication Provider Integration"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:27
msgid "GUIDANCE"
msgstr "GUIDANCE"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:28
msgid "Enable Guidance recommendations on cloud resources."
msgstr "Enable Guidance recommendations on cloud recursos."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:29
msgid "COSTING"
msgstr "COSTING"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:30
msgid ""
"Enable for |morpheus| to sync Costing data from the Cloud provider, when "
"available. For on-prem Clouds, enabling costing activates a costing service "
"designed to mirror the live costing experience of public clouds, including "
"invoicing with line items and real-time cost data (Operations > Costing > "
"Invoices). If your organization utilizes reserved instances and you want to "
"pull in related pricing data, some Cloud integrations include the option to "
"select `Costing and Reservations`. If this is not relevant, select `Costing`"
" to save money on additional calls to the Cloud provider's costing API."
msgstr ""
"Enable para |morpheus| to sync Costing datos desde el Cloud proveedor, "
"cuando disponible. For on-prem Clouds, enabling costing activates un costing"
" servicio designed to mirror el live costing experience of público clouds, "
"including invoicing con line elementos y real-time cost datos (Operations > "
"Costing > Invoices). If your organization utilizes reserved instances y you "
"want to pull in related pricing datos, algunos Cloud integrations include el"
" opción to select `Costing y Reservations`. If este no es relevante, select "
"`Costing` to save money on adicional calls to el Cloud proveedor's costing "
"API."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:31
msgid "DNS INTEGRATION"
msgstr "DNS INTEGRATION"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:32
msgid ""
"Records for instances provisioned in this cloud will be added to selected "
"DNS integration."
msgstr ""
"Records para instances provisioned in esta nube será be agregado to "
"seleccionado DNS integration."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:33
msgid "SERVICE REGISTRY"
msgstr "SERVICE REGISTRY"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:34
msgid ""
"Services for instances provisioned in this cloud will be added to selected "
"Service Registry integration."
msgstr ""
"Services para instances provisioned in esta nube será be agregado to "
"seleccionado Service Registry integration."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:35
msgid "CONFIG MANAGEMENT"
msgstr "CONFIG MANAGEMENT"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:36
msgid ""
"Select a Chef, Ansible or Puppet integration to be used with this Cloud."
msgstr ""
"Select un Chef, Ansible o Puppet integration to be used con este Cloud."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:37
msgid "CMDB"
msgstr "CMDB"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:38
msgid "Select CMDB Integration to automatically update selected CMDB."
msgstr "Select CMDB Integration to automáticamente update seleccionado CMDB."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:39
msgid "CMDB DISCOVERY"
msgstr "CMDB DISCOVERY"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:40
msgid ""
"When checked, any automatically discovered (unmanaged) servers onboarded "
"into |morpheus| from this Cloud will also have CMDB records created for "
"them."
msgstr ""
"When checked, cualquier automáticamente discovered (unmanaged) servers "
"onboarded en |morpheus| desde este Cloud será también tienen CMDB registros "
"creado para them."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:41
msgid "CHANGE MANAGEMENT"
msgstr "CHANGE MANAGEMENT"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:42
msgid ""
"Select an existing Change Management Integration to set on the Cloud. ex: "
"Cherwell"
msgstr ""
"Select un existente Change Management Integration to set on el Cloud. ex: "
"Cherwell"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:44
msgid "AGENT INSTALL MODE"
msgstr "AGENT INSTALL MODE"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:44
msgid ""
"SSH / WINRM / Guest Execution: |morpheus| will attempt to use SSH, WINRM or "
"Guest Execution for Agent install."
msgstr ""
"SSH / WINRM / Guest Execution: |morpheus| será attempt to use SSH, WINRM o "
"Guest Execution para Agent install."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:45
msgid ""
"Cloud Init / Unattend (when available): (DEFAULT) |morpheus| will utilize "
"Cloud-Init or Cloudbase-Init for agent install when provisioning images with"
" Cloud-Init/Cloudbase-Init installed. |morpheus| will fall back on SSH or "
"WINRM if cloud-init is not installed on the provisioned image. Morpheus will"
" also add Agent installation to Windows unattend.xml data when performing "
"Guest Customizations or utilizing syspreped images."
msgstr ""
"Cloud Init / Unattend (cuando disponible): (DEFAULT) |morpheus| será utilize"
" Cloud-Init o Cloudbase-Init para agent install cuando provisioning images "
"con Cloud-Init/Cloudbase-Init instalado. |morpheus| será fall back on SSH o "
"WINRM if cloud-init no es instalado on el provisioned image. Morpheus será "
"también add Agent instalación to Windows unattend.xml datos cuando "
"performing Guest Customizations o utilizing syspreped images."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:48
msgid "VDI GATEWAY"
msgstr "VDI GATEWAY"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:47
msgid ""
"Set a VDI Gateway for outbound communication from the |morpheus| Appliance "
"to the vdi endpoints. VDI Gateways can be added in ``/tools/vdi/gateways``"
msgstr ""
"Set un VDI Gateway para outbound communication desde el |morpheus| Appliance"
" to el vdi endpoints. VDI Gateways se puede agregar in "
"``/tools/vdi/gateways``"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:50
msgid "**CUSTOM LOGOS**"
msgstr "**CUSTOM LOGOS**"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:52
msgid ""
"When integrating a Cloud, it will appear by default throughout the UI with "
"its standard logo (VMware logo for VMware Clouds, etc.). If desired, you may"
" upload a custom logo that should appear instead. This might be useful for "
"MSPs which might not want to reveal the Cloud type underlying its services. "
"A dark mode version of the logo may also be uploaded if the standard logo "
"doesn't look right against the |morpheus| dark mode theme. Checking USE "
"DEFAULT CLOUD LOGOS allows the user to return to the standard logo for the "
"Cloud type without deleting the custom uploaded logo."
msgstr ""
"When integrating un Cloud, it será appear por defecto throughout el UI con "
"its standard logo (VMware logo para VMware Clouds, etc.). If desired, you "
"puede upload un personalizado logo que debería appear en cambio. This might "
"be useful para MSPs cual might no want to reveal el Cloud tipo underlying "
"its servicios. A dark modo versión of el logo puede también be uploaded if "
"el standard logo doesn't look right against el |morpheus| dark modo theme. "
"Checking USE DEFAULT CLOUD LOGOS permite al usuario return to el standard "
"logo para el Cloud tipo sin deleting el personalizado uploaded logo."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:54
msgid "**INVENTORY OPTIONS**"
msgstr "**INVENTORY OPTIONS**"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:56
msgid ""
"Inventory options allow you to set a default active or inactive state for "
"certain discovered resources. The list of available resources to configure "
"will vary based on the Cloud type and its supported resources. By default, "
"all possible resources for the Cloud type will be discovered in an active "
"state. Uncheck the box for some or all resources to discover them in an "
"inactive state. The list of potential resources that may appear include:"
msgstr ""
"Inventory opciones allow you to set un predeterminado activo o inactivo "
"state para certain discovered recursos. The lista of disponible recursos to "
"configure será vary basado en el Cloud tipo y its compatible recursos. By "
"predeterminado, todos possible recursos para el Cloud tipo será be "
"discovered in un activo state. Desmarque la box para algunos o todos "
"recursos to discover them in un inactivo state. The lista of potential "
"recursos que puede appear include:"

